  "historyNote": "#4770, eff 2-27-90; ss by #5789, eff 2-18-94; ss by #6916, eff 12-22-98; ss by #8303, EXEMPT, eff 4-1-05; ss by #12984, EXEMPT, eff 1-29-20; ss by #13109, EXEMPT, eff 9-23-20; ss by #14607, EXEMPT, eff 5-18-26",
